(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-cultivation-26","book":"mountain-ledger","cn":["季禾把旧土与新土摊开，指出填料的[[heterogeneity|成分不同]]。许庭提议做一笔[[deal|交易]]：村人保管米，他替工队付回填钱。领料处的[[sector|部门]]只问钱够不够，罗清问这种安排是否[[ethical|合乎道德]]。沈砚拉紧马的[[rein|缰绳]]，不让[[indignation|愤怒]]使众人冲柜台。柜前的[[chap|年轻人]]是季禾旧友，现替料石[[dealer|商人]]记账，堆旁的[[timber|木材]]早已腐朽。他说收到的是旧桩的钱，不是返工的钱，不能替别人把两笔账混成一笔。","工队的[[ethics|行为规范]]写着沟要保有[[overflow|溢流口]]。季禾[[furious|暴怒]]，指向被锯作短料的[[beam|横梁]]，说伤友当年的[[earnings|收入]]还有一半没拿。款项[[distribution|分配]]须和原票一起作[[examination|审查]]，不能拿一个漂亮的[[innovation|新办法]]遮掉旧欠款。柜前备的[[refreshment|茶点]]无人碰，墙上夸港埠[[civilization|文明]]的画也裂了。许庭的[[firm|商号]]曾接走拆梁，账里没有他付款给工队的回单。他这次没急着否认，要求先查运输船的印。","[[sunlight|日光]]穿过屋顶，照出一场不像庆功的证据[[exhibition|展示]]。拆桩的[[decree|命令]]与领料签票放在两边，石灰的[[absorption|吸水]]痕说明填土不同。单据的[[combination|合并]]才能解释为什么后沟干、前院湿，不能再拿天雨去[[fool|愚弄]]灾民。季禾用[[cord|绳索]]量两种料堆高度，含[[ferrous|铁质的]]渣料只在新堆中。许庭说这是[[corporate|共同的]]生意，谁也别独推责任；沈砚接受这句中的事实，不接受它成为人人不赔的理由。大家先分别保留能确认的一页。","季禾给的[[advice|意见]]是去旧水轮旁看出口。曾以[[turbine|叶轮机]]提升渠水的木轮早已停转，水不能[[freely|自由地]]走出，被一道[[hedge|树篱]]后的新土坝挡住。柜前年轻人愿[[fetch|取来]]备用图，沈砚则[[marshal|整理]]各村收据。对工队的[[allegiance|忠诚]]不要求季禾替当年错误辩解，他必须[[resist|抵抗]]自己想把伤友全说无辜的冲动。回填的[[funding|资金]]只到料处一半，另一半流去城里。罗清生起[[stove|炉火]]，伤友的[[fever|发热]]又开始了，问话不得不停下。","领料处的[[magistrate|地方官]]听说河改道，先被许庭的话激起[[anger|怒火]]，称村民污蔑。他不该急着[[congratulate|祝贺]]收税的[[gain|收益]]，因为[[weed|杂草]]和[[gravel|碎石]]已堵上逃水沟。沈砚递一张实际水位图，图不关谁有名。罗清照村人已有的[[recipe|食谱]]煮稀饭给未伤的人，不写药方，伤者的饭另由医馆评定。季禾[[bitterly|悲痛地]]发现工人的临时[[colony|聚居地]]在最低处，所有[[gold|黄金]]般夸张的收益都流向高岸。可他也承认，当年自己拿过一次赶工奖金，并未问为何停下返工。","官员终于肯派两人量水，却拒绝立刻归还所有扣盐。沈砚让他们与合作社的测量人同时走，避免又只有一套数字。许庭交出当年的运货回单，表示若旧欠款查实便抵销未付的拆料费，不肯承担火后的全部损失。这是有限让步，仍有很多需要核算。罗清的伤友烧得更高，必须赶去城里。季禾留下图纸给村人疏开一小段逃水沟，自己扶伤友上车。他们将查账与救人分两路继续，不能再为了把证据补得漂亮而拖慢病者的路。"],"en":["Ji spread old and new soil to show material [[heterogeneity|heterogeneity]]. Xu offered a [[deal|deal]] to fund restoration while villagers held rice. The supplies [[sector|sector]] asked only about money; Luo asked whether the arrangement was [[ethical|ethical]]. Shen held the [[rein|rein]] and restrained [[indignation|indignation]]. A young [[chap|chap]], Ji’s old colleague now working for a stone [[dealer|dealer]], stood beside rotten [[timber|timber]]. He had recorded payment for removed piles, not restoration, and would not merge them.","Work [[ethics|ethics]] required an [[overflow|overflow]] outlet. [[furious|Furious]], Ji pointed at a cut [[beam|beam]] and his friend’s unpaid [[earnings|earnings]]. Fund [[distribution|distribution]] required [[examination|examination]] with original tickets; an [[innovation|innovation]] could not hide debt. Nobody ate the [[refreshment|refreshment]] beneath a cracked [[civilization|civilization]] mural. Xu’s [[firm|firm]] had taken the beams without a crew payment receipt. He requested checking the boat seal instead of immediate denial.","[[sunlight|Sunlight]] lit an evidence [[exhibition|exhibition]] unlike a celebration. A removal [[decree|decree]], receipts and soil [[absorption|absorption]] marks needed [[combination|combination]] to explain dry rear and wet front ground. Rain could no longer [[fool|fool]] people. Ji used a [[cord|cord]] to measure heaps; [[ferrous|ferrous]] slag appeared only in new fill. Xu called it a [[corporate|corporate]] venture. Shen accepted shared involvement, not a reason nobody owed payment. Each party preserved a page it could verify.","Ji’s [[advice|advice]] was to inspect the old wheel outlet. Its wooden [[turbine|turbine]] had stopped; a new bank behind a [[hedge|hedge]] kept water from flowing [[freely|freely]]. The clerk would [[fetch|fetch]] a spare map while Shen began to [[marshal|marshal]] receipts. [[allegiance|Allegiance]] to workers meant Ji had to [[resist|resist]] calling his friend entirely innocent. Half the restoration [[funding|funding]] had gone to the city. Luo lit a [[stove|stove]]; the injured man’s [[fever|fever]] returned, ending the questioning.","The [[magistrate|magistrate]] reacted with [[anger|anger]]. He should not [[congratulate|congratulate]] tax [[gain|gain]] while [[weed|weed]] and [[gravel|gravel]] blocked drainage. Shen supplied a measured map, independent of prestige. Luo used a household [[recipe|recipe]] for uninjured people’s porridge, leaving patient meals to clinical judgment. Ji saw [[bitterly|bitterly]] that the workers’ [[colony|colony]] occupied the lowest ground while promised [[gold|gold]] flowed towards the high bank. He admitted accepting a speed bonus without questioning abandoned restoration.","The official agreed to measurements but not immediate release of all salt. Shen required cooperative surveyors beside official ones. Xu produced old delivery receipts and offered to offset proven debt against unpaid removal costs, refusing every fire loss. It was a limited concession requiring calculation. With the injured man’s fever rising, Luo needed the city. Ji left drawings for a small escape ditch and helped his friend aboard. Evidence and rescue would continue separately; a more complete case must not delay a patient."]});
